---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About — Spatialytics"
  description="Spatialytics is a Greater Minnesota software and spatial intelligence company building tools that keep high-value work and talent in the Brainerd Lakes area."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <p class="text-cyan-400 font-medium mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">About</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          Built in the Brainerd Lakes area for Greater Minnesota
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Spatialytics exists because the region has a clear gap in software product companies and high-wage tech roles — and because local businesses and organizations still need modern tools that big-city platforms don’t fully serve.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-20">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The mission</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Create year-round, high-value software and spatial intelligence work in Greater Minnesota while giving local businesses, print shops, municipalities, and natural resource partners tools that reduce overhead and improve outcomes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            That means building real products — not just consulting deliverables — and creating career paths that give CLC graduates and local talent a reason to stay.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The approach</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">01</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Domain first.</strong> GIS and location intelligence are core strengths, not side features.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">02</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Product mindset.</strong> Build systems that can grow beyond a single client engagement.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">03</span>
              <span><strong class="text-white">Local impact.</strong> Measure success by jobs, capacity, and value that stays in the region.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card border-cyan-500/20 mb-16">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2">Spatial</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Web GIS, 3D explorers, and location intelligence that non-specialists can actually use.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Print & POD</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">SaaS that helps local print shops compete with large platforms without giving up control.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-2">Business Apps</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Custom tools that cut administrative overhead and support better wages.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Why this region</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The Brainerd Lakes area and Northwest Minnesota have lower cost of living than the Twin Cities and a real quality-of-life advantage. What they don’t have at scale is a dense cluster of software product companies and computer & mathematical occupations.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          That gap is both a challenge and an opening. Spatialytics is built to help close it — one product and one partnership at a time.
        </p>
        <a href="/compare" class="btn-secondary">See the regional comparison →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center card">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Want to work together?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Projects, partnerships, and conversations are all welcome.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
